  "category": "finance",
  "title_zh": "全球重要银行名单出来了，中国五家大银行的位置没变",
  "title_en": "Global list of important banks is out: China's five big banks keep their places",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "11月25日，金融稳定理事会公布了今年全球系统重要性银行的名单。这份名单从2011年开始每年公布一次。今年一共有29家银行进入名单，和去年是同样的29家。",
      "en": "On November 25, the Financial Stability Board (FSB) published this year's list of global systemically important banks (G-SIBs). The list has been published once a year since 2011. This year 29 banks are on the list, the same 29 as last year."
    },
    {
      "zh": "名单把银行分成五个组，组越高，银行要多准备的资本就越多。中国有五家国有大银行在名单里：工商银行在第三组，农业银行、中国银行和建设银行在第二组，交通银行在第一组。这和去年完全一样。",
      "en": "The list divides banks into five groups (buckets). The higher the group, the more extra capital a bank must hold. Five of China's big state-owned banks are on the list: ICBC is in group 3; Agricultural Bank of China, Bank of China and China Construction Bank are in group 2; and Bank of Communications is in group 1. This is exactly the same as last year."
    },
    {
      "zh": "工商银行是去年从第二组升到第三组的，它是第一家进入第三组的中国银行。按照规定，工商银行的附加资本要求是2%，第二组的三家银行是1.5%，交通银行是1%。",
      "en": "ICBC moved up from group 2 to group 3 last year; it was the first Chinese bank to enter group 3. Under the rules, ICBC's additional capital requirement is 2%, the three banks in group 2 have 1.5%, and Bank of Communications has 1%."
    },
    {
      "zh": "在其他国家的银行中，摩根大通还是唯一在第四组的银行，第五组没有银行。法国巴黎银行从第二组升到了第三组，三菱日联金融集团从第二组降到了第一组。金融稳定理事会表示，组别变化主要是因为银行的业务规模和结构变了。",
      "en": "Among banks from other countries, JPMorgan Chase is still the only bank in group 4, and group 5 has no banks. BNP Paribas moved up from group 2 to group 3, and Mitsubishi UFJ Financial Group dropped from group 2 to group 1. The FSB said the group changes were mainly because the size and structure of banks' business had changed."
    }
  ],
